#9901
Southwestern Corner of the Cemetary~
   You are standing against a crumbling stone wall in the southwestern
corner of this ancient cemetary.  A few bones protrude from the ground,
adding tinges of pale yellow and white to the sickly greens and browns
of the tall grasses in this area.
   The cemetary continues to the north and east.
