#9917
The Mists~
   Shifting misty shapes inhabit this area, dancing and swirling on 
unseen winds, and dampening the ground beneath you as they touch the
grass with a chilling fog.  The shapes are truly amorphous, and you
are unable to tell if it is atmospheric, or if the fog really does
have a mind of its own.
   The cemetary continues in all directions, ending at a wall to the south.
~
