#9924
A Burial Cairn~
   You are standing atop a stone cairn.  Evil radiates from its base,
chilling your feet and making you wonder what could be contained under
the tons of rock on which you now stand.  Even now, as you look upon
it, you can see an etheral, skeletal arms reach though the stones to
claw at your feet, as though sensing the warmth of your body.
   The cemetary continues in all directions, and is split by the lane to
the east.
