#9944
Open Graves~
   You are standing amidst the litter of open, rotted wooden caskets
that lie shattered and strewn across the area, ripped apart by some
unknown creature that left scratches on the broken timbers.  Splinters
of bone and wood coat the grass with an almost snow-like blanket,
covering the green and brown reeds with splotches of sickly yellow
and bone white.
   The cemetary continues to the north, south, and west.  To the east
a tall mausoleum with thick vines dominates the rest of the cemetary.
