#9945
Brail'lin Eiahh Family Crypt~
   This is the elven family crypt of the Brail'lin clan.  Four elven
statues - one for each member of the family - stand in each of the
corners of the room.
   The statues to the south, a pair of male warriors in full battle
armor appear to have each borne a plaque on the pedestals beneath
them, but time and looters have long since removed any way of naming
the honored elves.  The likenesses however, suggest a kindred type
of resemblence.
   Opposite them, a robed mage and an elvish thief wielding a small
stone dagger stand tall and proud over the rest of the chamber as
though daring you to enter.
~
