A Paladin's Crypt~
   You are standing in the midst of a noble paladin's crypt.  The walls
are marble, as is the floor which supports a massive bier.  The ornate
carvings on the top of the bier depict two rampant unicorns, each with
its horns pointing to the northeast.
   The bier itself appears to be made of bloodstone and stands almost
four feet tall and at least twice that long.  A small, silver plaque
hangs bolted with silver spars into the bier.
