warrior~
The warrior appears to have been a tall, muscular man, though the passage
of time has rotted away muscle and flesh, leaving only a grey skeleton
with tatters of sinew hanging from its body.  The flesh of its lips is
pulled tightly back against its grin, and it seems to be mocking you,
daring you to find a fate equal to his own.
~
